WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Bitter office coffee?
Check these three variables.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:11.000
First, use the same coffee-to-water
ratio each time.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Second, let freshly boiled water
cool slightly before brewing.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Third, watch contact time so an
interruption does not extend the brew.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Change one variable, taste, then adjust.
Save this checklist.
